Z||000000||DecadenceR||06-26-2001||11:30 AM||||What would it take to put a "stock" 3rd brake light into a car that isn't equipped?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Steve Normington||06-26-2001||12:25 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DecadenceR:<BR><B>What would it take to put a "stock" 3rd brake light into a car that isn't equipped?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Third brake light and a logic circuit. JC Whitney has both. The logic circuit figures out when the light the brake light so that it doesn't blink with the turn signal.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||bHooper||06-26-2001||12:49 PM||||i have a 3rd brake light out of an '87 SE, if your interested.<P>email me.<P><P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT 5 speed<BR>*Black '86 SE Automatic||||reg||1
